  <item>
    <title>EP06 给宠物看病本质是给人看病</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/635b78f4aadc398d766190a0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">635b78f4aadc398d766190a0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Oct 2022 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>秋冬换季，董事会成员们和自己的宠物都要添衣保暖。这一期的《猫狗不懂事会》，我们邀请到了宠物医生杜大夫，和大家一起聊一聊宠物医疗、救治宠物过程的精彩故事。更有很多宠物医生这个熟悉又陌生的职业，其蜿蜒曲折的道路，我们会用两期节目来分享。先来听听我们的上半部分内容，初探宠物医生行业吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>宠物医生杜茂昌大夫</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a>如何一步一步变成了宠物医生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a>给经济型动物和伴侣动物看病的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a>伴侣动物看病原来也分这么多科室</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">12:33</a>猫狗的常见病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a>给动物看病其实就是给人看病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a>听说过么？不让给兔子喝水？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【工作组】</span></p><span></span><p><span>出品方：冠声播客Vocal-Supreme</span></p><span></span><p><span>主理人：王通</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作人：王通</span></p><span></span><p><span>监制&amp;发行：小智 能猫</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期制作：王通</span></p><span></span><p><span>视觉设计：肖喜庆</span></p><span></span><p><span>宣发团队：脑瓜头陆哈哈安琪拉</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>你可以在各大音频平台搜索《宠物不懂事会》订阅节目，晚17点更新。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：冠声播客Vocal supreme</span></p><span></span><p><span>新浪微博：冠声播客</span><strong><span>Vocal-Supreme</span></strong></p>]]></description>
